": "865151511043206", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035389_865151514376539_175007382094924936_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=jIKdXHIsZ40Q7kNvwFUCMch&_nc_oc=Adrt98792DmjOEUwzbPf_Wt7EE1GMuSbhBj5UMGx0pDEmDXOPiSN7vRuZZvl7ekzGs8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRuhKFGSbn-Uc6rlMefRDGg3Zu4u9w9NiYj8IvIoRuWag&oe=6B09CCC6"}, {"file_name": "Untitled-4.png", "id": "540251453759930", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974568_540251457093263_596185216737678114_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=awQ6Qwio1WUQ7kNvwHD1irO&_nc_oc=Ado-NgyqPhTyr5f1JWJ6ZqCX3lTw7kkLxs5EbDlWTt1fM2BK7qaaPJoE9mG5sYFiSzs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRT9JlVCMnzBh7_zQNcywt5bY5vecJdHxUbzRAdyKJ8eg&oe=6B09B6A5"}, {"file_name": "CTH-Screenshot-10.png", "id": "210466391035364", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031450_210466394368697_3171406121056240819_n.png?_nc_cat=106&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Nf3fSORilVkQ7kNvwGqzuvD&_nc_oc=AdpASjddZlMMfaqTPOxea1jflQYywKRWWDF_esi0Yet8fDCZWC3mOHrVHKH4QbO7FvU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTfCQMtr-0cxqy-tZMLCkcLmkiCqyk6OnmC0v7Nfif9dQ&oe=6B099C85"}, {"file_name": "Captain ToonHead Screenshot.png", "id": "426672885500768", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982658_426672888834101_6085981131912280130_n.png?_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=XGZE863aqrMQ7kNvwHs-AR8&_nc_oc=AdrWaiqzF14Miivq9JtC3OUw6anaV2FAWATe00aPaHtZ1j0RsErl_d9ABJmeoE_GcPE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTfXQ6ycRDlh1xOsrugy_OG1bu_uzzw8Kwe5BQL0pMT4w&oe=6B09AEE4"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Trailer-Oculus-Thumbnail.png", "id": "760441625080166", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974883_760441628413499_3472724892994893008_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=IYn2nNam0ZEQ7kNvwFaVmut&_nc_oc=AdrCCgajf5w9B9XT0m2NnamqFxhBQu43A__gZzPlfTPmBgw6aaUiG9ZKWo_elXJamTM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTntkJYiiT6eoflCqLBGgIq2_66rD3qnPtYiv4jAJyI1w&oe=6B09A033"}, "display_name": "Captain ToonHead vs The Punks from Outer Space", "keywords": ["towerdefense", "rts", "narrative", "cartoon", "humor"], "long_description": "\"\u2018Captain Toonhead Might Be The Most Over-The-Top VR Game Ever\"\n- VRScout\n\n\"One of the best tower defense games I have played in VR.\"\n- VRGameFaqs\n\n*An ACTION TOWER DEFENSE*\nYou'll move all over the map, hammering away to upgrade towers, throwing over-powered chanclas recklessly and taking control of your towers to unleash streams of heavy-metal powered hot sauce and shoot electric beams from weaponized pizza at your enemies. \n\n*The hero we got stuck with*\nAfter the squad sent by the World Treaty for Freedom (WTF) got fried in the \"burrito incident\", it falls to Elliott Salazar, the cartoon-obsessed space janitor and only survivor, to save Earth. There\u2019s a new captain onboard: Captain ToonHead! \n\n*Balance action and strategy*\nShooting alone will not defeat the waves of Cyber-C.H.I.C.K.E.N.s and Terra-S.H.A.R.K.s. Combine those PIG\u00f1ata tower bombs with your chancla throws in a very strategic way if you want to save the EnerCubes and defeat Nicholas Voorhees' P.U.N.K. army!", "short_description": "Ever wanted to beat a T-Rex up with a chancla, while building powerful towers that shoot pi\u00f1atas, hot sauce and heat-seeking fireworks? Captain ToonHead is the ACTION TOWER DEFENSE of your cartooniest dreams."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://teravisiongames.com/site/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Teravision Games", "support_website_url": nul